    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to present to the sales market this nicely presented three-bedroom, one-bathroom semi-detached home, ideally situated in the mature and well-established area of Santry. The property benefits from a spacious west-facing rear garden and a garage with access via a shared laneway to the side.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway leading to a bright living room to the front, complete with a feature fireplace. To the rear is a separate dining room with sliding doors opening directly onto the garden, while the galley-style kitchen offers ample storage with a range of fitted wall and floor units. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms together with a recently renovated family bathroom, providing comfortable and practical accommodation for family living.\r\n\r\nOldtown Road enjoys an excellent location in Santry, with a wide range of amenities within easy reach, including local shops, schools, parks, DCU and Beaumont Hospital. The area is well served by public transport and benefits from convenient access to the M1, M50, Dublin Airport and Dublin City Centre. Offering generous accommodation, excellent outdoor space and a highly convenient location, this property represents a fantastic opportunity for those seeking a family home in an established Santry neighbourhood."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation comprises of:\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nPorch – 1.49m x 0.69m\r\nProviding access to the main entrance hallway.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall – 1.66m x 2.70m\r\nA welcoming entrance hall with laminate flooring and carpeted stairs leading to the first floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room – 3.95m x 3.65m\r\nA bright and spacious reception room featuring a charming fireplace, wall-mounted lighting, classic ceiling coving and curtain rail with curtains.\r\n\r\nDining Room – 3.40m x 3.11m\r\nA bright and versatile space adjoining the kitchen, ideal for dining and entertaining. Features include carpeted flooring, classic ceiling coving and sliding patio doors opening directly onto the west-facing rear garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen – 2.21m x 3.23m\r\nA functional galley-style kitchen with tiled flooring, fitted wall and floor units, ample worktop space and tiled splashback. Appliances include a gas hob and oven, with plumbing for additional appliances. A rear door provides direct access to the garden.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding – 1.45m x 1.65m\r\nCarpeted landing connecting the bedrooms and bathroom, with a double-glazed window providing natural light.\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom – 3.35m x 4.09m\r\nA spacious and bright double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, laminate flooring and curtain rail with curtains.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 – 3.96m x 2.69m\r\nA generously sized double bedroom featuring laminate flooring and a double-glazed window with curtain rail and curtains.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 – 2.26m x 3.17m\r\nA comfortable single bedroom with laminate flooring and fitted storage. Well suited as a child's bedroom, guest room or home office.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom – 1.66m x 1.86m\r\nA well-appointed family bathroom fitted with a bathtub, W.C. and W.H.B., finished with attractive tiling and a double-glazed window.\r\n\r\nTotal Floor Area – Approx. 77 sq.m / 829 sq.ft\r\n\r\nExternally, the front of the property features a gated garden with a paved pathway leading to the entrance. To the rear is a particularly generous, low-maintenance west-facing garden, complete with a brick-built shed and garage, which is accessible via the shared laneway. The garden provides excellent outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining and dining.\r\n\r\n\r\nViewings are strictly by appointment only via the local agents Smith & Butler Estates on 018665600."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Chain free sale\r\nNicely maintained and low maintenance large West-facing rear garden\r\nFeature fireplace\r\nGas heating \r\nBuilt in wardrobes in all the three bedrooms \r\nGarage\r\nSide lane access\r\nExcellent location good transport links and great local amenities nearby"
      },
      {
